## 7. Naming conventions (proposed: agree at the next sync)

The GDD fixes code style only. These asset-name prefixes are a suggestion to keep folders searchable.

| Asset | Pattern | Example |
|---|---|---|
| C# class and file | `PascalCase` | `BeliefGrid.cs` |
| Prefab | `PascalCase` | `Wisp.prefab`, `CargoCrate.prefab` |
| Material | `M_<Name>` | `M_WallPanel_Grey` |
| Texture | `T_<Name>_<Map>` | `T_Wisp_BaseColor`, `T_Wisp_Normal` |
| ScriptableObject config | `<Thing>Config` | `RifleConfig.asset`, `HunterConfig.asset` |
| Animation clip | `<Unit>_<Action>` | `Warden_Fire`, `Warden_Death` |
| Scene | `PascalCase` | `Main.unity`, `Gunitha.unity` |
| Blender file | `<Model>_v<NN>_<stage>.blend` | `Wisp_v02_topology.blend` |